      202      create new-fin-code-cor-acc.
      203      buffer-copy old-fin-code-cor-acc to new-fin-code-cor-acc.
      204   end.
      205   for each old-fin-code-cor-acc-attr  no-lock on error undo, return error SUBSTITUTE("&1 &2 &3", return-value, error-status:get-message(1), error-status:get-message(2)):
      206      create new-fin-code-cor-acc-attr.
      207      buffer-copy old-fin-code-cor-acc-attr to new-fin-code-cor-acc-attr.
